			"date": "2026-04-24T21:15:18.118Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>khalidabuhakmeh</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ThibaultDu\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ThibaultDu</span></a></span> “but it robs you of what would have otherwise been an educational and intrinsically worthwhile journey” resonates so well for me</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116461761891643711",
			"parentId": "116461752688148805",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh/116461761852108980",
			"author": {
				"name": "Khalid ⚡",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/296/176/354/255/607/original/70d4899634530145.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-24T21:17:37.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ThibaultDu\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>ThibaultDu</span></a></span> AI by design is meant to isolate us all from each other. I think that's the part I'm sad about. </p><p>It's a tragedy of the commons when everyone has their own private car to work without those pesky social interactions.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116461790247452945",
			"parentId": "116461761891643711",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@ThibaultDu/116461790200403019",
			"author": {
				"name": "Thibault D.",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@ThibaultDu",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/734/800/021/512/545/original/63e74fa542b78169.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-24T21:24:50.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>khalidabuhakmeh</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> That's one of the strongest concerns I have raised at my workplace. If you are using your AI agent to discuss architectural design decisions that you would have otherwise discussed with your colleagues, that's a loss. There is value in friction, like they write in the article too. Would \"you\" rather end up working alone with your agents (and being hypothetically 3x more efficient), or same efficiency but continue have people around you?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
