			"date": "2026-04-24T21:27:04.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>khalidabuhakmeh</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I am glad we are starting to have these discussions, than you both 🙏</p>",
