			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh/116461799833683214",
			"author": {
				"name": "Khalid ⚡",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/296/176/354/255/607/original/70d4899634530145.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-24T21:27:17.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ThibaultDu\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>ThibaultDu</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> that's not even accurate. </p><p>You'll never be as productive as you could be without the help of others. </p><p>We all have blind-spots, weaknesses, and misunderstandings.</p><p>Without additional perspectives you could spend hours, days, months going down a pathway paved of your own ignorance.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116461825160394823",
