			"date": "2026-04-25T07:23:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> this shit brings out the worst of cognitive biases where the one time it worked makes up for the fallout of the 20 times it didn't. the mere potential to get something done faster seems to justify whatever cost.<br><br>and besides the other 200 times we used an AI tool nothing very bad happened immediately after! so it was probably a positive! /s</p>",
