		{
			"id": "116464974819127842",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://en.osm.town/@mcepl/116464973878493100",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matěj Cepl 🇪🇺 🇨🇿 🇺🇦",
				"url": "https://en.osm.town/@mcepl",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-25T10:54:29.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>I don’t see the situation as so bad (perhaps my employer is just more sane), but this <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-new-google-funded-data-center-will-be-powered-by-a-massive-gas-plant/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">wired.com/story/a-new-google-f</span><span class=\"invisible\">unded-data-center-will-be-powered-by-a-massive-gas-plant/</span></a> leads to deep depression.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.osm.town/tags/GoogleFail\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>GoogleFail</span></a> <a href=\"https://en.osm.town/tags/GlobalWarming\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>GlobalWarming</span></a> <a href=\"https://en.osm.town/tags/AICraze\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>AICraze</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
