			"date": "2026-04-25T11:44:19.000Z",
			"content": "<p>Oof. I empathize with this person from my own experience burning out of tech 3 years ago and sympathize with how AI-accelerated enshittification amplifies those feelings.</p><p>h/t <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://ky.fyi/posts/ai-burnout?ref=activitypub\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">ky.fyi/posts/ai-burnout?ref=ac</span><span class=\"invisible\">tivitypub</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://alpaca.gold/tags/AI\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>AI</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116465320111755668",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@jtolj/116465320007513744",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jesse",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@jtolj",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-25T12:22:31.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I think this has always been an industry that is difficult to navigate if you care about building high quality things that are not doing evil. Arbitrary deadlines with pressure to ignore security and correctness, dark patterns, selling out user privacy. The companies that pretended to care about this stuff usually actually didn’t and just needed the mask to attract talented engineers. (1/2)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
