			"date": "2026-04-25T20:01:53.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I've been thinking the same thing lately. I'm wondering if my current career has hit the wall, and it's time for a new one. This was my third career, so I would actually enjoy doing and learning a job I've never done before.</p><p>But with the USA about to tank the global economy, maybe I should not risk a new job?  (As old as I am, you'd think I wouldn't have to worry about that. But I do.)</p>",
